      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    par_rate_5 = 0.0437\n    spot_rates = [0.025, 0.030, 0.035, 0.040]\n    coupon = par_rate_5\n    discount_factors = [\n        1 / (1 + spot_rate) ** year\n        for year, spot_rate in enumerate(spot_rates, start=1)\n    ]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    present_value_of_coupons = coupon * sum(discount_factors)\n    discount_factor_5 = (1 - present_value_of_coupons) / (1 + coupon)\n    five_year_spot_rate = (1 / discount_factor_5) ** (1 / 5) - 1\n    answer = round(five_year_spot_rate * 100, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
